### 测试：将待办标记为已完成
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/meetings/todos/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}
### 新增会议待办
POST http://localhost:3000/api/meetings/1/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "完成会议纪要页面优化",
  "assignee": "张三",
  "deadline": "下周一"
}
### 删除指定待办
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/meetings/todos/9
### 编辑待办事项
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/meetings/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "完成会议纪要页面优化（已修改）",
  "assignee": "张三",
  "deadline": "2026-10-05"
}
### 修改会议标题
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/meetings/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "MeetMind 产品需求评审会议"
}
POST http://localhost:3000/api/ai/regenerate/2
